{"id":"vol8-02","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-02/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":405.51,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.0,"text":"Part 2. You will hear part of a radio program in which a successful businessman is advising","words":[["Part",0.0,0.22],["2.",0.22,0.64],["You",1.6,2.0],["will",2.0,2.18],["hear",2.18,2.4],["part",2.4,2.72],["of",2.72,2.9],["a",2.9,3.04],["radio",3.04,3.36],["program",3.36,3.96],["in",3.96,4.62],["which",4.62,4.78],["a",4.78,4.94],["successful",4.94,5.48],["businessman",5.48,6.18],["is",6.18,6.56],["advising",6.56,7.0]]},{"start":7.0,"end":14.28,"text":"listeners on how to become a self-made millionaire. First you have some time to look at questions","words":[["listeners",7.0,7.64],["on",7.64,8.28],["how",8.28,8.48],["to",8.48,8.58],["become",8.58,8.94],["a",8.94,9.24],["self",9.24,9.5],["-made",9.5,9.94],["millionaire.",9.94,10.6],["First",11.64,12.44],["you",12.44,12.68],["have",12.68,12.86],["some",12.86,13.04],["time",13.04,13.44],["to",13.44,13.68],["look",13.68,13.82],["at",13.82,13.96],["questions",13.96,14.28]]},{"start":14.28,"end":65.3,"text":"11 to 16. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["11",14.28,14.86],["to",14.86,15.12],["16.",15.12,15.62],["Now",61.38,61.72],["listen",61.72,62.12],["carefully",62.12,62.58],["and",62.58,62.96],["answer",62.96,63.38],["questions",63.38,63.82],["11",63.82,64.48],["to",64.48,64.74],["16.",64.74,65.3]]},{"start":68.72,"end":75.82,"text":"Everybody dreams of becoming a millionaire one day. So we asked Arthur Knowles who made","words":[["Everybody",68.72,69.52],["dreams",69.52,70.04],["of",70.04,70.4],["becoming",70.4,70.82],["a",70.82,71.12],["millionaire",71.12,71.72],["one",71.72,72.14],["day.",72.14,72.52],["So",73.22,73.62],["we",73.62,73.88],["asked",73.88,74.34],["Arthur",74.34,74.74],["Knowles",74.74,75.24],["who",75.24,75.52],["made",75.52,75.82]]},{"start":75.82,"end":81.2,"text":"his millions in the plumbing business to give the budding entrepreneurs among you a few","words":[["his",75.82,76.1],["millions",76.1,76.5],["in",76.5,76.78],["the",76.78,76.92],["plumbing",76.92,77.2],["business",77.2,77.72],["to",77.72,78.42],["give",78.42,78.62],["the",78.62,78.8],["budding",78.8,79.28],["entrepreneurs",79.28,79.9],["among",79.9,80.32],["you",80.32,80.64],["a",80.64,80.9],["few",80.9,81.2]]},{"start":81.2,"end":86.42,"text":"tips on how to make your first million. Arthur, welcome to the programme.","words":[["tips",81.2,81.54],["on",81.54,81.82],["how",81.82,82.02],["to",82.02,82.2],["make",82.2,82.42],["your",82.42,82.9],["first",82.9,83.46],["million.",83.46,83.9],["Arthur,",84.52,84.86],["welcome",85.4,85.72],["to",85.72,85.92],["the",85.92,86.02],["programme.",86.02,86.42]]},{"start":86.76,"end":87.32,"text":"Thanks Sue.","words":[["Thanks",86.76,87.08],["Sue.",87.08,87.32]]},{"start":87.82,"end":91.14,"text":"So Arthur, what advice do you have for our listeners?","words":[["So",87.82,88.24],["Arthur,",88.24,88.66],["what",89.12,89.46],["advice",89.46,89.82],["do",89.82,90.04],["you",90.04,90.14],["have",90.14,90.34],["for",90.34,90.58],["our",90.58,90.76],["listeners?",90.76,91.14]]},{"start":91.8,"end":96.86,"text":"Well one thing I've heard people say is that when you're starting up a business you can't","words":[["Well",91.8,92.06],["one",92.06,92.28],["thing",92.28,92.58],["I've",92.58,93.02],["heard",93.02,93.16],["people",93.16,93.4],["say",93.4,93.86],["is",93.86,94.18],["that",94.18,94.32],["when",94.32,94.5],["you're",94.5,94.78],["starting",94.78,95.14],["up",95.14,95.4],["a",95.4,95.5],["business",95.5,95.86],["you",95.86,96.48],["can't",96.48,96.86]]},{"start":96.86,"end":103.42,"text":"afford to make mistakes. Well I believe in the old saying a person who never made a mistake","words":[["afford",96.86,97.12],["to",97.12,97.34],["make",97.34,97.54],["mistakes.",97.54,98.06],["Well",99.06,99.4],["I",99.4,99.98],["believe",99.98,100.3],["in",100.3,100.56],["the",100.56,100.64],["old",100.64,