,194.83,195.09],["workers",195.09,195.49],["look",195.49,195.73],["up",195.73,195.99],["to",195.99,196.25],["because",196.25,196.63],["you've",196.63,197.29],["been",197.29,197.61],["seen",197.61,198.07],["to",198.07,198.31],["make",198.31,198.49],["the",198.49,198.65],["right",198.65,198.83],["decisions.",198.83,199.31],["You",199.85,200.23],["have",200.23,200.41],["to",200.41,200.55],["be",200.55,200.67],["able",200.67,200.87]]},{"start":200.87,"end":207.71,"text":"to control people but listen to them at the same time. Some people are driven to make their","words":[["to",200.87,201.03],["control",201.03,201.49],["people",201.49,201.99],["but",201.99,202.49],["listen",202.49,203.21],["to",203.21,203.53],["them",203.53,203.73],["at",203.73,203.83],["the",203.83,203.91],["same",203.91,204.19],["time.",204.19,204.55],["Some",205.37,205.71],["people",205.71,206.09],["are",206.09,206.59],["driven",206.59,207.03],["to",207.03,207.37],["make",207.37,207.53],["their",207.53,207.71]]},{"start":207.71,"end":214.79,"text":"company's successful, but that too often leads to a ruthless approach. Then there's the question","words":[["company's",207.71,208.25],["successful,",208.25,208.79],["but",208.99,209.09],["that",209.09,209.91],["too",209.91,210.17],["often",210.17,210.51],["leads",210.51,211.03],["to",211.03,211.33],["a",211.33,211.49],["ruthless",211.49,211.95],["approach.",211.95,212.51],["Then",213.37,214.07],["there's",214.07,214.37],["the",214.37,214.47],["question",214.47,214.79]]},{"start":214.79,"end":222.95,"text":"of taking risks, even calculated ones. I personally feel it's actually better to tread carefully","words":[["of",214.79,215.07],["taking",215.07,215.57],["risks,",215.57,216.05],["even",216.33,216.73],["calculated",216.73,217.41],["ones.",217.41,217.95],["I",218.85,219.07],["personally",219.07,219.61],["feel",219.61,220.03],["it's",220.03,220.99],["actually",220.99,221.31],["better",221.31,221.63],["to",221.63,221.85],["tread",221.85,222.27],["carefully",222.27,222.95]]},{"start":222.95,"end":229.35,"text":"when it comes to taking short-term risks. You need a degree of vision, certainly, but it's","words":[["when",222.95,223.21],["it",223.21,223.33],["comes",223.33,223.57],["to",223.57,223.81],["taking",223.81,224.17],["short",224.17,224.69],["-term",224.69,224.95],["risks.",224.95,225.39],["You",225.95,226.15],["need",226.15,226.39],["a",226.39,226.83],["degree",226.83,227.13],["of",227.13,227.39],["vision,",227.39,227.73],["certainly,",227.89,228.37],["but",228.87,229.11],["it's",229.11,229.35]]},{"start":229.35,"end":235.35,"text":"easy to get carried away by your desire to increase profits, and if things go wrong,","words":[["easy",229.35,229.61],["to",229.61,229.79],["get",229.79,229.97],["carried",229.97,230.35],["away",230.35,230.73],["by",230.73,230.91],["your",230.91,231.19],["desire",231.19,231.67],["to",231.67,231.91],["increase",231.91,232.53],["profits,",232.53,233.05],["and",233.51,233.99],["if",233.99,234.13],["things",234.13,234.39],["go",234.39,234.75],["wrong,",234.75,235.35]]},{"start":235.35,"end":237.87,"text":"Then you can end up losing more than you gain.","words":[["Then",235.35,235.45],["you",235.45,235.81],["can",235.81,236.01],["end",236.01,236.23],["up",236.23,236.41],["losing",236.41,236.81],["more",236.81,237.23],["than",237.23,237.41],["you",237.41,237.55],["gain.",237.55,237.87]]},{"start":241.61,"end":247.83,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the program, you have some time to look at questions 17 to 20.","words":[["Before",241.61,241.93],["you",241.93,242.19],["hear",242.19,242.43],["the",242.43,242.61],["rest",242.61,242.87],["of",242.87,242.99],["the",242.99,243.11],["program,",243.11,243.61],["you",244.01,244.59],["have",244.59,244.77],["some",244.77,244.95],["time",244.95,245.37],["to",245.37,245.59],["look",245.59,245.73],["at",245.73,245.89],["questions",245.89,246.21],["17",246.21,247.19],["to",247.19,247.45],["20.",247.45,247.83]]},{"start":268.15,"end":271.73,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 17 to 20.","words":[["Now",268.15,268.51],["listen",268.51,268.83],["and",268.83,269.17],["answer",269.17,269.61],["questions",269.61,270.01],["17",270.01,271.01],["to",271.01,271.29],["20.",271.29,271.73]]},{"start":275.17,"end":279.53,"text":"So if you have a great idea for a business, what should you do next?","words":[["So",275.17,275.55],["if",275.55,275.97],["you",275.97,276.09],["have",276.09,276.21],["a",276.21,276.31],["great",276.31,276.57],["idea",276.57,277.21],["for",277.21,277.41],["a",277.41,277.53],["business,",277.53,277.79],["what",278.41,278.67],["should",278.67,278.83],["you",278.83,278.99],["do",278.99,279.15],["next?",279.15,279.53]]},{"start":280.15,"end":285.69,"text":"Well, the first thing to ask yourself is whether there's a need for your product or service.","words":[["Well,",280.15,280.53],["the",280.77,280.97],["first",280.97,281.25],["thing",281.25,281.49],["to",281.49,281.67],["ask",281.67,281.93],["yourself",281.93,282.29],["is",282.29,282.95],["whether",282.95,283.31],["there's",283.31,283.63],["a",283.63,283.73],["need",283.73,284.07],["for",284.07,284.37],["your",284.37,284.53],["product",284.53,284.93],["or",284.93,285.21],["service.",285.21,285.69]]},{"start":285.69,"end":290.27,"text":"companies? Can you cater for people's needs better than existing companies?","words":[["companies?",285.69,285.85],["Can",286.35,286.63],["you",286.63,286.87],["cater",286.87,287.25],["for",287.25,287.55],["people's",287.55,288.05],["needs",288.05,288.37],["better",288.37,289.05],["than",289.05,289.25],["existing",289.25,289.69],["companies?",289.69,290.27]]},{"start":291.13,"end":295.11,"text":"You don't need to worry about whether it's original or not because there isn't always","words":[["You",291.13,291.39],["don't",291.39,291.55],["need",291.55,291.71],["to",291.71,291.89],["worry",291.89,292.09],["about",292.09,292.35],["whether",292.35,292.65],["it's",292.65,292.93],["original",292.93,293.33],["or",293.33,293.63],["not",293.63,293.83],["because",293.83,294.19],["there",294.19,294.63],["isn't",294.63,294.87],["always",294.87,295.11]]},{"start":295.11,"end":300.83,"text":"enough of a demand for completely new ideas. And the second thing to ask yourself is","words":[["enough",295.11,295.43],["of",295.43,295.65],["a",295.65,295.77],["demand",295.77,296.15],["for",296.15,296.53],["completely",296.53,296.93],["new",296.93,297.35],["ideas.",297.35,297.87],["And",298.77,299.01],["the",299.01,299.15],["second",299.15,299.49],["thing",299.49,299.81],["to",299.81,299.99],["ask",299.99,300.23],["yourself",300.23,300.57],["is",300.57,300.83]]},{"start":300.83,"end":307.93,"text":"not what colour should the packet be or how much should it cost, but do I care enough","words":[["not",300.83,301.61],["what",301.61,302.09],["colour",302.09,302.75],["should",302.75,302.99],["the",302.99,303.15],["packet",303.15,303.43],["be",303.43,303.79],["or",303.79,304.09],["how",304.09,304.81],["much",304.81,305.09],["should",305.09,305.27],["it",305.27,305.37],["cost,",305.37,305.79],["but",306.21,306.35],["do",306.35,306.95],["I",306.95,307.19],["care",307.19,307.63],["enough",307.63,307.93]]},{"start":307.93,"end":313.21,"text":"about this idea to dedicate the next ten years of my life to it? Because realistically","words":[["about",307.93,308.21],["this",308.21,308.49],["idea",308.49,308.91],["to",308.91,309.15],["dedicate",309.15,309.59],["the",309.59,309.85],["next",309.85,310.07],["ten",310.07,310.33],["years",310.33,310.59],["of",310.59,310.79],["my",310.79,310.99],["life",310.99,311.35],["to",311.35,311.57],["it?",311.57,311.75],["Because",311.97,312.39],["realistically",312.39,313.21]]},{"start":313.21,"end":319.57,"text":"that's how long it will take. Tell us how you got started Arthur. How do you explain your","words":[["that's",313.21,313.81],["how",313.81,313.97],["long",313.97,314.25],["it",314.25,314.39],["will",314.39,314.55],["take.",314.55,314.99],["Tell",315.39,315.77],["us",315.77,31